  "sandbox_stdout": "** J=1.50680305 n=512 t=0s\nParent: n=512, J=1.50680305\nLengths: [256, 320, 384, 448, 512, 576, 640, 768, 896, 1024]\n\n=======================================================\nPHASE 1: Smooth GD multi-start (300s)\n=======================================================\n  n= 256: M=0.0036021 J=1.844279\n  n= 320: M=0.0027437 J=1.755965\n  n= 384: M=0.0021765 J=1.671524\n  n= 448: M=0.0018138 J=1.625129\n  n= 512: M=0.0014719 J=1.507189\n  n= 576: M=0.0013659 J=1.573460\n  n= 640: M=0.0012196 J=1.561108\n  n= 768: M=0.0010138 J=1.557190\n  n= 896: M=0.0008585 J=1.538375\n  n=1024: M=0.0007474 J=1.530583\n  After Phase 1: J=1.50680305 n=512\nPhase 1 took: 1508820s\n\n=======================================================\nPHASE 2: LP Mirror Descent (700s)\n=======================================================\n    LP iter 0: M=0.00147149 best=0.00147149 no_imp=1\n    LP iter 200: M=0.00230744 best=0.00147149 no_imp=17\n  Main LP took 703s\n  Trying LP on n=1024\n  Trying LP on n=896\n  After Phase 2: J=1.50680305 n=512\n\n=======================================================\nPHASE 3: Coordinate Descent\n=======================================================\n  ** J=1.50680303 n=512 t=869s\n  After Phase 3: J=1.50680303 n=512\n\n=======================================================\nPHASE 4: Final LP Polish\n=======================================================\n\n=======================================================\nFINAL: J=1.50680303 n=512 time=877s\n=======================================================",
